# ── Brandfetch (brand identity layer) ──────────────────────────────────────
# Both are CLIENT IDs from https://developers.brandfetch.com — not secret keys,
# but keep them out of the repo all the same. Absent values leave the brand
# layer dormant (logos fall back to stored site icons and monograms).
#
# Logo Link client id — public by design: it rides in every hotlinked
# <img src="https://cdn.brandfetch.io/..."> URL the browser loads.
BRANDFETCH_LOGO_CLIENT_ID=
# Brand Search client id — server-side only, used exclusively by the manual
# admin brand-search action (never by prospect enrichment).
BRANDFETCH_SEARCH_CLIENT_ID=
